WEBVTT

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:01.376
but that it could transform
into an electronic book.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:03.067
So it's sort of an electronic book.

00:12:03.091 --> 00:12:05.853
This is where when you go outside,
it's in black and white.

00:12:05.877 --> 00:12:07.656
The games buttons are missing,

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:09.975
but it'll also be a games machine,

00:12:09.999 --> 00:12:11.336
book machine.

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:13.856
Set it up this way,
and it's a television set.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:18.000
Etc., etc. -- is that enough
for simulcast? OK, sorry.

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:23.016
I'll let Jim decide
which way to send it afterwards.

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:24.736
OK. Seven countries.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.336
(Laughter)

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:31.416
I say "maybe" for Massachusetts,
because they actually have to do a bid.